 "protocol": {
  "summary": "Pure-moment apparatus (servomotor + cardan shaft, unconstrained; inferior box on an x-y translation table); 4 sinusoidal cycles to 8 Nm at 2.8 deg/s in flexion, extension, right/left lateral bending, right/left axial rotation; last cycle evaluated at 0, 2, 4, 6, 8 Nm; no preload. Day 1: whole L4-S1 tested, L4-L5 reduced stepwise (SSL, ISL, FL, FC, VA, PLL, ALL, nucleus) with L5-S1 intact; day 2: L5-S1 reduced. Tekscan 6900 sensors calibrated per Wilson et al.",
  "how_to_simulate": [
   "Model L4-S1 (or L4-L5 / L5-S1 FSU) without facet capsules; fix S1 (or the caudal vertebra)",
   "Apply pure moments 2-8 Nm in extension, lateral bending and axial rotation, no preload",
   "Report facet contact force at L4-L5 and L5-S1 (N) at each moment"
  ],
  "subject_model": null,
  "notes": "Loads small vs sensor range (LB 6.2%, extension 10.2%). Which facet (side) is reported is not stated. Three specimens failed in flexion (no flexion forces). ROM data (Table 1) belong to other cards."
 },
